Run these four

E1: Which DB services do Claims apps use?

fetch dt.entity.service
| filter serviceType == "DATABASE_SERVICE"
| fields id, dbService = entity.name, tags
| expand tag = tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize apps = countDistinctExact(apmid), by:{dbService}
| sort apps desc
| limit 40


E2: Do DB problems carry Claims APMIDs?

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-30d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter contains(lower(event.name), "database") or contains(lower(event.name), "mssql")
      or contains(lower(event.name), "oracle") or contains(lower(event.name), "db2")
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| dedup display_id
| summarize problems = count(), active = countIf(event.status == "ACTIVE"),
            apps = countDistinctExact(apmid), by:{event.name}
| sort problems desc
| limit 20


If this returns nothing, Option B is out.

